 r←Test_POSTRefresh_PendingRuns url;Assert;Authed;state
⍝ Check a refresh worker releases the lock and clears the pending flag.
⍝ The only test that runs a worker to completion, so the only cover for the release path:
⍝ if the release breaks, refresh wedges permanently after the first refresh.
 r←0
 Assert←##.Assert
 Authed←##.MAIN.Authed
 state←#.DCMS.GLOBAL.refresh
 :Trap 0
     'Refresh already running at start of test'Assert ##.WaitRefreshIdle 150
     'Expected 202 Accepted'Assert 202=('POST'Authed url,'/admin/refresh').Run.HttpStatus
     'Expected 202 Accepted'Assert 202=('POST'Authed url,'/admin/refresh').Run.HttpStatus
     'Refresh did not return to idle'Assert ##.WaitRefreshIdle 600
     'Pending flag not cleared'Assert 0=state.pending
     r←1
 :EndTrap
⍝ Teardown: never leak a refresh worker into the next test
 {}##.WaitRefreshIdle 600
